window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Once upon a time, a hunter broke a vampire's heart…</b></p> <p>As the trials for Sangui City's throne reach their climax, Red finds herself at the center of a millennia-old prophecy. As the newly awakened dhampir, she holds the power to reshape the future—or destroy it.</p> <p>Octavia Beaumont, driven by her quest for acceptance, must confront the painful truths of her past to secure her place as ruler.</p> <p>But as ancient secrets unravel, she discovers that the greatest threat may come from those she trusted most.</p> <p>With demons rising and alliances shifting, Red and Octavia face their greatest challenge yet: saving a city on the brink of chaos while navigating the complexities of love.</p> <p>To claim victory, they must:</p> <p>Unmask a villain hiding in plain sight</p> <p>Decide if love can overcome betrayal</p> <p>Make sacrifices that will echo through generations</p> <p>As the boundary thins and magic surges back into the city, Red and Octavia stand at a crossroads. Their choices will determine not just their own fates, but the destiny of Sangui City itself.</p> <p>In a tale where blood is power and trust is currency, can a hunter and a vampire forge a future from the ashes of the past? Or will the weight of history crush their love forever?</p> <p><i>This gripping conclusion features political intrigue, enemies to lovers, supernatural battles, chosen one prophecy, found family, and two women fighting for their right to love and lead. With themes of redemption, identity, and the true meaning of family, it delivers one hell of an end to an epic romance saga.</i></p>"; 
